WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:05.400 --> 00:06.401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:06.411 --> 00:08.400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

4
00:08.430 --> 00:09.950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

5
00:10.000 --> 00:11.501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

6
00:11.511 --> 00:12.890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

7
00:12.899 --> 00:13.900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

8
00:13.911 --> 00:14.912
[or any particular group of people.]

9
00:15.114 --> 00:19.270
Ma'am, someone sent us information about Hype Tech, the company that won the smart card project.

10
00:19.278 --> 00:21.440
They have a history of colluding to rig government bids.

11
00:21.518 --> 00:24.120
If it's true, award the contract to the second-place bidder instead.

12
00:24.456 --> 00:27.720
Do you know that doll called Babina-Babini or something?

13
00:27.874 --> 00:31.360
- Bambinana? - My daughter really wants one.

14
00:31.686 --> 00:34.640
I want a Bambinana doll with a red hat.

15
00:34.667 --> 00:36.720
And you'll have to line up. There are only a few available.

16
00:37.136 --> 00:40.000
Babe! Thank you so much.

17
00:40.010 --> 00:42.080
I don't think our relationship is healthy anymore.

18
00:42.224 --> 00:45.062
I've just been a little busy lately.

19
00:45.270 --> 00:47.920
- But… - Honey, your coffee is getting cold.

20
00:48.352 --> 00:49.800
This is what I tried to tell you.

21
00:50.440 --> 00:51.441
Goodbye, Nina.

22
00:51.646 --> 00:54.200
Jolene, you won't believe what just happened to me.

23
00:54.247 --> 00:58.248
Nopnapha called me in to sign the smart card project contract.

24
00:58.472 --> 01:01.560
Your plan worked. That company got kicked out,

25
01:01.580 --> 01:03.440
and we got the contract instead.

26
01:03.581 --> 01:07.400
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

27
01:08.760 --> 01:10.261
Oh! The pretty sister is here!

28
01:16.342 --> 01:20.560
Mama Bear and Papa Bear fight and shout.

29
01:21.622 --> 01:26.040
Things break, and their voices thunder.

30
01:26.267 --> 01:28.200
Little Bear begins to cry,

31
01:30.200 --> 01:31.960
his heart filled with fear.

32
01:33.806 --> 01:35.600
Will the sky come crashing

33
01:37.576 --> 01:38.920
down on him?

34
01:39.758 --> 01:42.280
Keep reading, Daddy.

35
01:49.539 --> 01:53.320
Little Bear trembles, scared out of his wits.

36
01:56.619 --> 02:01.520
He hides inside a hollow tree.

37
02:03.120 --> 02:05.160
Keep reading, Daddy.

38
02:06.336 --> 02:09.080
Tetris, why aren't you asleep yet?

39
02:09.195 --> 02:11.800
Not yet, but Dad's already asleep.

40
02:13.616 --> 02:15.960
Honey? Honey!

41
02:19.307 --> 02:21.520
Oh, you're back.

42
02:23.211 --> 02:24.360
Where's Titus?

43
02:27.440 --> 02:29.441
Sroi just took her to bed.

44
02:32.075 --> 02:33.120
Good, you're here.

45
02:33.366 --> 02:35.480
You can finish reading Tetris his bedtime story.

46
02:36.603 --> 02:38.790
Sweetie, Daddy's going to bed now.

47
02:46.126 --> 02:47.127
I'm off to bed.

48
02:54.611 --> 02:57.475
It's late, sweetheart. Daddy can finish the story tomorrow.

49
03:00.755 --> 03:04.360
Wow, that's beautiful! Who drew this?

50
03:04.406 --> 03:07.305
- I did. - You drew this?

51
03:07.830 --> 03:11.360
Then why did you draw me wearing glasses? I don't wear glasses.

52
03:11.515 --> 03:14.520
That's not you, Mom. That's my teacher.

53
04:51.790 --> 04:53.240
Oh! The pretty sister is here!

54
04:53.536 --> 04:55.080
- See? - We just talked about this.

55
05:11.480 --> 05:12.481
Shit!

56
05:28.488 --> 05:29.840
Bambinana Red Hat!

57
05:45.411 --> 05:47.250
- Hi, Veekit. - Hi.

58
05:47.931 --> 05:48.932
Where's Titus?

59
05:53.414 --> 05:54.800
Hey! Hey!

60
05:56.043 --> 05:59.960
Um, is that Bambinana Red Hat real?

61
06:00.486 --> 06:02.880
Of course. Do you collect them too?

62
06:03.334 --> 06:07.120
Yes! I have every version except that Red Hat one.

63
06:08.456 --> 06:10.136
Can I buy it from you?

64
06:13.475 --> 06:14.476
Sorry, sweetie. It's not for sale.

65
06:14.856 --> 06:17.480
My boyfriend bought it for me in America. It's special to me.

66
06:18.400 --> 06:21.320
Please. I'm begging you.

67
06:21.424 --> 06:24.000
Name your price. I'll have my mom transfer the money right away.

68
06:24.283 --> 06:27.760
Please! I really want it for my birthday.

69
06:27.806 --> 06:30.475
Please sell it to me. I'm begging you.

70
06:30.480 --> 06:31.720
Is your birthday coming up?

71
06:32.280 --> 06:33.281
Yes.

72
06:35.304 --> 06:36.305
Well, then...

73
06:37.310 --> 06:40.200
I'll give it to you for free.

74
06:41.390 --> 06:43.720
But on one condition.

75
06:44.531 --> 06:47.600
Anything. Just tell me what you want. I'll do anything.

76
06:47.720 --> 06:49.070
Can we be friends?

77
06:49.816 --> 06:52.400
Of course! I'm Titus. What's your name?

78
06:52.584 --> 06:53.585
I'm Ta.

79
06:55.107 --> 06:56.643
Happy birthday, Titus.

80
06:57.896 --> 06:59.395
Thank you, Ta.

81
07:02.747 --> 07:04.520
Now that we're friends,

82
07:05.059 --> 07:07.440
does that mean I'm invited to your birthday party?

83
07:07.907 --> 07:11.160
Of course. You'll be my VIP guest.

84
07:17.166 --> 07:18.167
Titus!

85
07:20.246 --> 07:21.247
Titus!

86
07:23.056 --> 07:24.680
Titus! Titus!

87
07:27.707 --> 07:28.708
Where have you been?

88
07:29.582 --> 07:32.451
A nice lady gave me a Bambinana Red Hat.

89
07:33.630 --> 07:36.206
She's so kind and really pretty.

90
07:36.430 --> 07:37.431
Isn't it cute?

91
07:39.400 --> 07:40.401
Where is she?

92
07:40.611 --> 07:41.612
Over there.

93
07:45.395 --> 07:46.396
Huh? Where did she go?

94
07:49.700 --> 07:52.360
You little troublemaker. I bet you stole it from someone.

95
07:52.680 --> 07:53.681
Causing trouble again, aren't you?

96
07:54.606 --> 07:57.607
I'm in a good mood today. I won't ruin it by yelling at you, you little queen.

97
07:58.974 --> 08:01.320
Hey! Where did you sneak off to without telling anyone?

98
08:01.598 --> 08:03.560
If you get kidnapped and sold off, don't expect me to rescue you.

99
08:24.904 --> 08:28.680
Everyone, this is Ta! She's my new friend!

100
08:28.987 --> 08:33.160
She gave me a limited-edition Bambinana Red Hat for my birthday!

101
08:34.558 --> 08:37.200
Ta is the kindest person in the whole world.

102
08:37.998 --> 08:41.499
From now on, whenever you and your friends do something fun, don't forget to invite me.

103
08:41.640 --> 08:44.041
Or I could help you with your homework.

104
08:44.050 --> 08:45.300
I'm really good at math and English.

105
08:47.910 --> 08:48.960
Isn't my cake gorgeous?

106
08:49.100 --> 08:52.160
- It's so pretty! I love eating here. - Let's go!

107
08:55.200 --> 08:56.760
- Come eat with us, Ta. - Sure.

108
09:07.680 --> 09:09.280
It's a pleasure to be working with you.

109
09:11.798 --> 09:12.934
Likewise.

110
09:13.456 --> 09:15.040
I've been following your work for a long time.

111
09:15.147 --> 09:17.200
I'm so happy to have the chance to work with you.

112
09:17.648 --> 09:20.649
I'm happy to work with such a talented team too.

113
09:21.632 --> 09:23.520
Let's work together for our country.

114
09:24.040 --> 09:25.041
Of course.

115
09:26.707 --> 09:29.454
And your other partner's name is...

116
09:30.856 --> 09:33.331
Nina. That's her nickname.

117
09:33.857 --> 09:34.858
Oh, Nina.

118
09:35.120 --> 09:36.560
Where is she?

119
09:37.910 --> 09:39.900
She's working in America.

120
09:40.118 --> 09:42.960
But she can work remotely from there. It's no problem.

121
09:44.064 --> 09:46.920
Young people really can work from anywhere these days.

122
09:47.288 --> 09:50.840
Some work together for years without ever meeting in person.

123
09:53.246 --> 09:55.522
Now that we're going to be working together,

124
09:55.966 --> 09:57.040
can I ask you something?

125
09:58.456 --> 09:59.457
Were you the one

126
10:00.440 --> 10:04.720
who tipped me off that Hype Tech had rigged bids before?

127
10:08.110 --> 10:09.843
Come on, admit it. I'm not upset.

128
10:10.776 --> 10:13.090
It's a good thing you dug that up.

129
10:13.886 --> 10:16.307
If the opposition had found out first, I'd be in serious trouble.

130
10:17.320 --> 10:20.760
Yes. Munin was the one who dug up that information from the company.

131
10:22.160 --> 10:23.161
Munin?

132
10:24.918 --> 10:26.280
I mean Nina.

133
10:26.976 --> 10:30.064
Oh, isn't she working in America?

134
10:31.515 --> 10:34.394
She hacked into the company's system to get the information.

135
10:35.600 --> 10:36.601
I see.

136
10:36.859 --> 10:38.700
Your friend is very talented.

137
10:39.070 --> 10:42.200
Let me know when she comes to Thailand. I'd love to invite her to dinner.

138
10:42.856 --> 10:43.857
Of course.

139
10:47.557 --> 10:48.558
Excuse me a moment.

140
10:51.539 --> 10:53.400
- What's up, sweetheart? - Where are you, Mom?

141
10:53.659 --> 10:55.318
Mom, you have to come home right now.

142
10:55.451 --> 10:57.560
I'm at the Ministry. What's wrong, sweetheart?

143
10:57.792 --> 10:59.560
That homewrecking bitch has invaded our house, Mom.

144
10:59.702 --> 11:01.960
Who? Mutta?

145
11:02.224 --> 11:03.600
I don't know where Titus met her.

146
11:03.846 --> 11:05.334
But she invited her to her birthday party at our house.

147
11:07.526 --> 11:11.723
Napha, I bet Mutta deliberately got close to the kids.

148
11:12.032 --> 11:13.760
That bitch is more cunning than we thought.

149
11:14.187 --> 11:16.870
You need to get home and deal with her before she takes over our house.

150
11:17.680 --> 11:18.920
That bitch Mutta!

151
11:25.046 --> 11:26.960
One, two, cheese!

152
11:31.900 --> 11:32.901
Ta.

153
11:33.614 --> 11:34.615
Can I talk to you for a second?

154
11:35.518 --> 11:36.899
Dad, let's take a selfie.

155
11:38.456 --> 11:39.520
Come on, everyone. Get in.

156
11:41.739 --> 11:43.640
One, two, cheese!

157
11:47.558 --> 11:49.835
Titus, go play with your friends for a bit.

158
11:49.960 --> 11:51.360
I need to talk to Ta privately.

159
11:52.112 --> 11:56.280
Don't take too long. Ta's my guest today, not yours.

160
11:57.771 --> 11:58.772
Okay, sweetie.

161
12:03.144 --> 12:05.160
What is it, Titus' dad?

162
12:07.864 --> 12:09.960
Let's talk inside. There are too many people here.

163
12:21.083 --> 12:22.160
How did you meet Titus?

164
12:23.435 --> 12:24.870
And why didn't you tell me you were coming today?

165
12:26.600 --> 12:27.800
I wanted to surprise you.

166
12:28.640 --> 12:31.400
Come on, Director. Smile.

167
12:31.699 --> 12:32.936
Why so serious?

168
12:33.763 --> 12:37.035
You should be happy I get along with your daughter.

169
12:37.528 --> 12:40.760
I'm going to be her mother someday, you know.

170
12:44.480 --> 12:47.707
I know, and I'm happy about that.

171
12:49.158 --> 12:50.360
But not today, Ta.

172
12:51.050 --> 12:52.880
Babe, please go home for now.

173
12:53.608 --> 12:56.320
If Napha comes home, all hell will break loose.

174
12:57.582 --> 13:00.240
I doubt she'd dare make a scene in front of the kids and parents

175
13:00.350 --> 13:02.200
at her own daughter's birthday party.

176
13:03.600 --> 13:04.601
You never know.

177
13:07.107 --> 13:08.800
We know you're here to cause trouble.

178
13:09.320 --> 13:11.160
How many times have you tried to provoke Aunt Napha?

179
13:11.635 --> 13:14.051
It won't work this time. Just go home.

180
13:14.110 --> 13:17.539
Hey, Veekit. This is none of your business.

181
13:18.227 --> 13:20.320
Go somewhere else. I'll handle this myself.

182
13:20.830 --> 13:22.958
You? What can you possibly do?

183
13:23.731 --> 13:25.320
Ta's more likely to get the better of you.

184
13:25.987 --> 13:27.806
And Aunt Napha might come after you too.

185
13:28.083 --> 13:29.084
Veekit!

186
13:30.606 --> 13:33.080
Ta! Veekit! Let's play hide-and-seek! Come on!

187
13:35.200 --> 13:36.600
Come on, Ta! Hurry!

188
13:44.085 --> 13:45.500
So how exactly are you going to handle this?

189
13:46.659 --> 13:47.660
I don't know, damn it!

190
13:48.494 --> 13:51.000
Let's just let them play for a while.

191
13:51.600 --> 13:52.680
I'll take Ta home myself.

192
13:53.832 --> 13:55.200
Napha probably won't be back until this evening.

193
13:56.547 --> 13:58.080
Hurry up, Veekit.

194
14:06.678 --> 14:08.360
Rock, paper, scissors!

195
14:09.718 --> 14:11.170
Rock, paper, scissors!

196
14:12.803 --> 14:14.300
Rock, paper, scissors!

197
14:14.804 --> 14:17.300
How about this? I'll volunteer to be the seeker first.

198
14:19.955 --> 14:21.401
Okay, let's start.

199
14:22.027 --> 14:23.028
I'm going to count now.

200
14:23.480 --> 14:24.481
One.

201
14:25.179 --> 14:26.180
Two.

202
14:27.180 --> 14:28.181
Three.

203
14:29.067 --> 14:31.400
Four, five, six, seven.

204
14:32.200 --> 14:33.201
Eight.

205
14:33.720 --> 14:34.721
Nine.

206
14:35.320 --> 14:36.321
Ten.

207
14:38.894 --> 14:41.040
Ta, let's hide behind the bed in my room.

208
14:41.091 --> 14:43.280
- I bet Veekit will never find us. Come on. - Wait, Titus.

209
14:43.971 --> 14:45.464
If we hide together,

210
14:45.838 --> 14:48.165
we'll both get caught at the same time.

211
14:48.664 --> 14:50.040
I think we should hide separately.

212
14:52.555 --> 14:53.556
What's that room?

213
14:53.792 --> 14:56.120
That's Tetris's room. Better stay out of there.

214
14:56.251 --> 14:57.280
Or they'll make a fuss again.

215
14:58.107 --> 14:59.108
Then...

216
15:00.198 --> 15:02.300
- What about that room? - That's Mom's room.

217
15:03.691 --> 15:06.240
Oh, but you can hide in the prayer room!

218
15:06.358 --> 15:08.880
There's a hiding spot under the altar table. It's over there.

219
15:09.243 --> 15:11.044
- Okay, I'll hide in the prayer room. - Okay!

220
16:17.637 --> 16:20.120
They use burner phones to arrange their jobs.

221
16:20.616 --> 16:22.040
Once the job's done, they crush the phones and throw them away.

222
16:22.867 --> 16:24.440
You'll never be able to track any of them down.

223
16:38.868 --> 16:39.869
Napha!

224
16:40.952 --> 16:42.453
Why are you home so early?

225
16:42.878 --> 16:44.250
Because termites have invaded my house.

226
16:44.798 --> 16:47.840
Am I supposed to wait until they bring the whole house down? I have to get rid of them!

227
16:48.072 --> 16:49.073
Where is she?

228
16:49.123 --> 16:50.936
- Where's that queen termite? - Calm down, Napha.

229
16:51.198 --> 16:53.320
- Where is she? - She's playing hide-and-seek, Mom.

230
16:53.422 --> 16:55.600
- I saw Titus take her inside to hide. - Tetris!

231
16:56.798 --> 16:59.000
Napha, the house is full of guests.

232
16:59.240 --> 17:00.600
Can we please not make a scene today?

233
17:01.246 --> 17:03.720
That homewrecking bitch has the nerve to come into my home!

234
17:03.960 --> 17:05.560
If I don't confront her now, when should I?

235
17:05.570 --> 17:07.720
Keep your voice down, Napha.

236
17:09.470 --> 17:11.520
Hello, ma'am.

237
17:12.531 --> 17:13.532
Hello.

238
17:15.400 --> 17:17.160
How's the food? Is it good?

239
17:17.577 --> 17:21.200
It's delicious. And all the desserts are from famous shops.

240
17:21.795 --> 17:23.360
I picked them out especially for you.

241
17:24.544 --> 17:26.560
Please enjoy yourselves. Excuse me.

242
17:27.568 --> 17:32.169
Ma'am, we were just discussing the parent-teacher association.

243
17:32.443 --> 17:34.720
There's a project we'd love your support with.

244
17:36.286 --> 17:38.240
You can discuss it with Director Jenphop.

245
17:39.571 --> 17:40.672
Stay with Daddy, Tetris.

246
17:44.572 --> 17:45.573
Director?

247
17:46.600 --> 17:47.601
Right this way, please.

248
17:47.952 --> 17:49.520
Honestly, these people!

249
17:49.776 --> 17:53.360
The moment they see I'm a minister, they start sucking up to me.

250
17:59.963 --> 18:03.040
Slap that bitch, Mom. Give her one for me too.

251
18:29.832 --> 18:30.833
You bitch, Mutta!

252
19:00.000 --> 19:01.001
- Gotcha! - Oh!

253
19:04.350 --> 19:05.720
You can't catch me, ma'am.

254
19:07.150 --> 19:10.500
Mutta! How dare you barge into my bedroom!

255
19:10.974 --> 19:11.975
Get out!

256
19:13.667 --> 19:14.760
It's your bedroom today.

257
19:15.246 --> 19:18.040
But who knows? It might be mine someday.

258
19:18.752 --> 19:19.753
Or...

259
19:20.078 --> 19:21.840
Would you rather I share a bedroom with the Director?

260
19:22.320 --> 19:23.321
Come here!

261
19:23.654 --> 19:25.920
I won't let you contaminate my room with your filth.

262
19:26.515 --> 19:27.800
This room is no place for you.

263
19:27.998 --> 19:29.672
Come here! Get over here!

264
19:30.000 --> 19:32.640
This is a limited edition. It's really hard to find.

265
19:32.750 --> 19:35.640
But Ta managed to get one for me. Isn't she amazing?

266
19:38.000 --> 19:39.301
Come join your friends over here.

267
19:39.904 --> 19:40.905
Let's see.

268
19:41.638 --> 19:43.000
Is everyone here? Are we missing anyone?

269
19:43.558 --> 19:46.363
Ta's missing. You'll never find her! Ah!

270
19:48.912 --> 19:51.360
And my little sister, Kambum, too.

271
19:56.347 --> 19:57.348
Come here!

272
19:58.971 --> 20:02.400
Tell me! What are you trying to destroy in my family?

273
20:03.067 --> 20:04.768
I don't have to lift a finger.

274
20:05.430 --> 20:08.300
Your family's already falling apart, isn't it?

275
20:09.031 --> 20:11.400
Would it be falling apart if it weren't for a termite like you?

276
20:14.384 --> 20:17.640
Let me tell you something. I've been very merciful to you.

277
20:17.974 --> 20:20.600
I've let you live your shameless life this long.

278
20:20.886 --> 20:24.120
Ever heard of a fatal bloodstream infection?

279
20:24.886 --> 20:26.120
Being burned alive inside a tire?

280
20:27.072 --> 20:28.073
Being thrown into a river with weights tied to you?

281
20:29.254 --> 20:31.040
Take your pick. How do you want to die?

282
20:31.627 --> 20:34.454
You dare talk about such evil things in front of Buddha?

283
20:35.456 --> 20:38.480
You must know what a terrible sinner you are.

284
20:38.987 --> 20:41.080
That's why you built such a huge prayer room.

285
20:41.766 --> 20:43.040
Let me tell you something.

286
20:43.483 --> 20:45.640
Even if you built a giant pagoda over your house,

287
20:45.872 --> 20:46.920
you'd never escape me.

288
20:47.648 --> 20:50.360
I'll haunt you like a ghost,

289
20:50.800 --> 20:52.840
until you finally get what you deserve.

290
20:53.824 --> 20:54.880
If you're a ghost,

291
20:55.936 --> 20:58.037
then I'll be the exorcist who gets rid of you!

292
21:01.136 --> 21:04.267
May the Buddha, Dharma, and Sangha protect me.

293
21:04.736 --> 21:08.400
May all evil spirits who wish me harm vanish.

294
21:17.470 --> 21:19.720
You wandering spirit! You filthy whore!

295
21:19.784 --> 21:21.280
Get the hell out of my house! Now!

296
21:21.795 --> 21:23.950
You can splash holy water on me all you want.

297
21:24.000 --> 21:25.001
I'll just get wet.

298
21:25.171 --> 21:27.880
But you can't kick me out! Is this even your house?

299
21:28.056 --> 21:29.157
It's the Director's house.

300
21:29.363 --> 21:31.160
The reason he never wants to come home after work

301
21:31.262 --> 21:33.680
is because seeing your face is like seeing a ghost.

302
21:33.814 --> 21:36.040
You're the one who needs to leave!

303
21:44.803 --> 21:47.600
Jenphop may have built this house,

304
21:47.875 --> 21:49.920
but it's on my land.

305
21:50.238 --> 21:51.923
And the title deed is in my name.

306
21:52.040 --> 21:53.480
Get that through your thick skull, you idiot.

307
21:54.024 --> 21:55.325
Trying to run away from me? Come here.

308
21:55.678 --> 21:56.679
Get over here.

309
21:57.891 --> 21:59.840
Just die already, you bitch from hell.

310
22:15.840 --> 22:16.841
Bye-bye!

311
22:17.232 --> 22:20.160
- Goodbye! - Goodbye!

312
22:20.320 --> 22:22.440
- Come again! - Thank you, sweetheart!

313
22:22.606 --> 22:24.840
- Goodbye! - Goodbye!

314
22:28.126 --> 22:30.040
Please come to Kampaong and Kambum's birthday party.

315
22:30.100 --> 22:32.080
You and Titus are both invited.

316
22:32.232 --> 22:33.133
Of course.

317
22:33.192 --> 22:35.880
- We'll be going now. Goodbye. - Goodbye!

318
22:35.987 --> 22:37.288
Kambum, say goodbye to the Minister, sweetie.

319
22:37.486 --> 22:38.487
Come on, say goodbye.

320
22:42.400 --> 22:44.440
Oh, I'm sorry. I should get going.

321
22:47.046 --> 22:48.047
What's the matter with her?

322
22:48.470 --> 22:53.040
Mom, what's wrong with her? Why did she cry so much when she saw you?

323
22:54.131 --> 22:57.571
She was probably... sleepy, sweetheart. That's why she was fussy.

324
23:02.320 --> 23:05.480
Ta, what happened? Why are you all wet?

325
23:06.614 --> 23:09.440
I ran into a ghost, so I washed myself with holy water.

326
23:09.776 --> 23:11.640
This house is seriously haunted.

327
23:14.432 --> 23:16.795
But are you leaving already, Ta?

328
23:16.934 --> 23:21.450
Stay for dinner with us! Please? Pretty please?

329
23:21.520 --> 23:24.280
Let her go. She has things to take care of.

330
23:25.344 --> 23:26.345
Right?

331
23:28.038 --> 23:31.800
Your house is beautiful, ma'am. So lush and peaceful.

332
23:32.518 --> 23:33.519
It must be lovely to live here.

333
23:34.800 --> 23:36.600
Can I come visit more often?

334
23:37.200 --> 23:38.301
Of course.

335
23:38.486 --> 23:41.520
You're welcome anytime, Ta. Don't be shy.

336
23:42.528 --> 23:43.529
Well, then...

337
23:44.427 --> 23:46.028
I'll be going now, ma'am.

338
23:47.723 --> 23:49.611
See you at the Ministry, Director.

339
23:50.939 --> 23:51.940
See you, Veekit.

340
23:59.355 --> 24:00.760
I'll walk Ta to her car.

341
24:04.776 --> 24:06.611
I'll come too.

342
24:06.800 --> 24:07.801
No need.

343
24:08.360 --> 24:09.661
We need to talk.

344
24:14.912 --> 24:17.419
I'm ordering you to stay away from that bitch Mutta.

345
24:18.422 --> 24:20.464
Don't ask questions. That's an order.

346
24:21.000 --> 24:22.101
Just do as I say.

347
24:22.624 --> 24:25.400
If you don't give me a reason, I won't do it.

348
24:27.254 --> 24:28.928
Since when did you stop listening to me, Titus?

349
24:29.419 --> 24:31.800
A long time ago. You only just noticed?

350
24:32.235 --> 24:33.615
She's your father's mistress.

351
24:34.195 --> 24:35.896
You can't be friends with your father's mistress!

352
24:38.888 --> 24:42.360
That's not true! Ta said she works with Dad at the Ministry.

353
24:42.616 --> 24:44.400
She never said she was Dad's mistress.

354
24:45.352 --> 24:46.353
Right?

355
24:47.353 --> 24:48.354
Uh...

356
24:49.500 --> 24:51.501
Just do what Mom said.

357
24:51.635 --> 24:53.260
Listen to your mom, Titus.

358
24:53.651 --> 24:56.648
Besides, you're still young. Let the adults handle this.

359
24:57.000 --> 24:58.995
Tetris, don't bring this up again.

360
25:02.822 --> 25:04.747
But I want Ta to be Dad's mistress!

361
25:05.574 --> 25:08.360
Oh my God, Titus! How can you say that?

362
25:09.900 --> 25:11.801
Ta gave me a Bambinana.

363
25:12.160 --> 25:13.915
She came to my birthday party.

364
25:14.459 --> 25:17.515
She talks to me every day and always replies to my messages.

365
25:17.883 --> 25:18.884
Unlike you.

366
25:19.456 --> 25:21.320
You never do anything for me.

367
25:21.531 --> 25:22.532
Titus!

368
25:23.211 --> 25:25.227
But Mom gave birth to us.

369
25:25.638 --> 25:29.520
You'll hurt her feelings if you say things like that, you know?

370
25:30.070 --> 25:31.200
Apologize to your mother right now.

371
25:31.782 --> 25:32.783
No!

372
25:33.702 --> 25:36.760
I want Ta to be my mom! I want Ta to be my mom!

373
25:38.064 --> 25:40.640
I didn't teach her to say that.

374
25:40.883 --> 25:41.884
She said it on her own.

375
25:46.947 --> 25:48.640
You want that bitch to be your mother so badly?

376
25:57.320 --> 25:59.221
You want that bitch to be your mother so badly?

377
25:59.923 --> 26:00.924
Yes!

378
26:02.110 --> 26:03.111
Fine!

379
26:04.163 --> 26:05.640
- Give me that! - Auntie!

380
26:06.264 --> 26:08.440
- Auntie! - Give me back my stuff!

381
26:11.240 --> 26:12.920
You want that bitch to be your mother so badly?

382
26:13.000 --> 26:14.301
Mom, give it back!

383
26:14.867 --> 26:16.320
Just die already, you damn banana!

384
26:16.643 --> 26:17.644
- Mom! - Napha!

385
26:42.659 --> 26:45.280
This is what I'll use to prove

386
26:45.448 --> 26:47.000
that Nopnapha ordered my sister's murder.

387
26:50.040 --> 26:52.920
It's just a burner phone. Anyone could have one.

388
26:53.541 --> 26:56.300
The court won't accept that alone as evidence.

389
26:57.123 --> 26:58.371
I'll find more evidence.

390
26:58.942 --> 27:00.840
We need several pieces of evidence to build a solid case,

391
27:00.872 --> 27:01.960
so she won't be able to get away with it.

392
27:02.334 --> 27:05.040
I've already gotten close to her younger child.

393
27:05.560 --> 27:07.761
Now I'll find a way to get close to the older one.

394
27:08.014 --> 27:09.615
I'm sure I'll uncover plenty more useful information.

395
27:11.491 --> 27:12.492
Oh, Munin.

396
27:13.336 --> 27:15.918
I signed the Smart Card project contract today.

397
27:16.840 --> 27:20.910
If we pull this off, it'll be a huge boost to our company's reputation.

398
27:21.736 --> 27:24.835
I know. That's why I got you to submit a bid.

399
27:27.347 --> 27:30.718
But weren't you planning to sabotage the project to ruin Nopnapha's reputation?

400
27:32.000 --> 27:33.001
Munin.

401
27:33.601 --> 27:36.760
If she goes down, we go down with her.

402
27:38.602 --> 27:40.163
Can't you go after her for something else?

403
27:41.120 --> 27:43.595
Just leave our project out of it. Please.

404
27:46.219 --> 27:48.300
Okay, fine.

405
27:50.352 --> 27:53.552
I promise I won't put our company at risk.

406
27:55.152 --> 27:56.880
But you have to help me take her down.

407
27:57.768 --> 27:59.816
Don't you have a friend in forensic science?

408
28:01.160 --> 28:04.000
Get this phone checked for Nopnapha's fingerprints.

409
28:36.400 --> 28:37.801
It's jasmine-scented, Mom.

410
28:38.400 --> 28:41.160
Perfect for a senior citizen like you.

411
28:43.842 --> 28:45.443
I'm a minister, sweetheart.

412
28:46.486 --> 28:48.200
Oh, right, Mom.

413
28:49.579 --> 28:50.800
But it smells lovely, Tetris.

414
28:52.798 --> 28:55.920
Tetris, thank you for being such a good kid.

415
28:56.163 --> 28:57.600
And not giving you any headaches.

416
28:59.320 --> 29:02.120
I know

417
29:02.483 --> 29:04.484
you have so much to deal with every day.

418
29:07.987 --> 29:10.504
If there's anything I can do to help, just tell me.

419
29:11.384 --> 29:13.080
You're the sweetest, darling.

420
29:15.792 --> 29:16.793
Thank you.

421
29:21.056 --> 29:22.057
It smells lovely.

422
29:23.600 --> 29:24.601
It's me.

423
29:25.088 --> 29:26.089
Yes?

424
29:28.112 --> 29:29.113
Auntie,

425
29:29.819 --> 29:31.504
I think you should go talk to Titus.

426
29:32.710 --> 29:33.880
She seems really upset.

427
29:35.422 --> 29:38.320
She's locked herself in her room and won't answer when I call.

428
29:39.246 --> 29:40.723
Forget that drama queen, Veekit.

429
29:41.358 --> 29:42.803
She'll come out when she gets hungry.

430
29:44.600 --> 29:45.640
I'll talk to her tomorrow.

431
29:46.622 --> 29:48.259
For now, let her think about what she's done.

432
29:48.691 --> 29:49.720
Off to bed, everyone. Go on.

433
29:52.366 --> 29:53.800
Who put it here?

434
30:21.798 --> 30:22.960
Wait, Auntie.

435
30:25.600 --> 30:26.601
Auntie!

436
30:27.101 --> 30:29.275
If you scold Titus now, it'll only make things worse.

437
30:31.158 --> 30:33.000
Why don't you try talking to her calmly?

438
30:46.659 --> 30:47.660
Titus!

439
30:49.331 --> 30:51.075
Open the door. I want to talk to you.

440
30:57.294 --> 30:59.944
If you don't answer, I'm unlocking the door.

441
31:03.715 --> 31:04.716
Give me the key.

442
31:09.920 --> 31:10.921
Titus!

443
31:28.928 --> 31:29.929
Auntie.

444
31:34.075 --> 31:36.416
I hate Mom! I want a new mom!

445
31:47.800 --> 31:48.801
Titus.

446
31:49.280 --> 31:50.294
Come on, tell me.

447
31:50.848 --> 31:52.560
Did you tell Mom and Dad you were going out?

448
31:54.352 --> 31:56.758
Why should I have to tell anyone?

449
31:57.040 --> 31:58.600
I have you as my other mom now.

450
31:59.041 --> 32:00.042
My second mom.

451
32:00.422 --> 32:02.800
Huh? What do you mean, second mom?

452
32:05.224 --> 32:07.624
Well, you're Dad's mistress.

453
32:08.376 --> 32:09.464
So that makes you my second mom.

454
32:14.040 --> 32:15.760
If I really were your mom,

455
32:16.800 --> 32:18.520
which mom would you love more?

456
32:18.984 --> 32:21.800
Nopnapha or Mutta?

457
32:22.915 --> 32:24.886
Mutta, of course!

458
32:25.200 --> 32:27.520
I'd even stop being Nopnapha's daughter.

459
32:31.195 --> 32:33.480
I'm happy you love me, Titus.

460
32:33.960 --> 32:37.150
But your mom and dad are still married.

461
32:37.518 --> 32:39.200
So I can't be your other mom.

462
32:40.227 --> 32:42.688
Hurry up and eat. Then I'll call your dad to pick you up.

463
32:43.840 --> 32:45.860
No! I'm not going home!

464
32:45.886 --> 32:47.560
Can I stay with you, Ta?

465
32:47.600 --> 32:49.960
I don't want to see Mom.

466
32:50.001 --> 32:51.680
- Please! I don't want to go home! - Okay, okay. You don't have to.

467
32:52.638 --> 32:54.160
But I need to call Veekit.

468
32:54.752 --> 32:57.387
Your family needs to know you're here, or they'll worry.

469
33:08.598 --> 33:10.944
Hello, Ta. I was just about to call you.

470
33:14.112 --> 33:15.158
Is Titus with you?

471
33:15.819 --> 33:17.760
Yeah, she's with me.

472
33:17.915 --> 33:20.075
Tell everyone not to worry. She's safe.

473
33:22.560 --> 33:24.960
Titus is with Ta. She's safe.

474
33:25.880 --> 33:27.200
- Give me that. I'll talk to her. - Ta!

475
33:27.300 --> 33:29.840
Can you calm down? Let me handle this.

476
33:32.582 --> 33:33.720
What did she say?

477
33:34.139 --> 33:35.520
She refuses to go home.

478
33:36.100 --> 33:38.560
Can you come talk to her? I don't know what else to say.

479
33:39.286 --> 33:41.579
Okay. Look after her until I get there.

480
33:42.043 --> 33:43.744
Just keep her company and talk about anything.

481
33:43.800 --> 33:46.318
But don't scold her, criticize her, or lecture her.

482
33:46.520 --> 33:47.521
That'll only make things worse.

483
33:48.056 --> 33:49.057
I'll be there as soon as I can.

484
33:54.755 --> 33:56.360
I'll go see Titus at Ta's condo.

485
33:57.683 --> 33:59.240
Make sure you bring her home.

486
33:59.710 --> 34:02.800
If that woman refuses to let her go, we'll call the police.

487
34:02.900 --> 34:05.901
Mom, Titus went to Ta on her own.

488
34:06.101 --> 34:08.238
And Ta asked me to come help talk her into coming home.

489
34:09.214 --> 34:11.251
Can you all stop assuming the worst about Ta?

490
34:13.358 --> 34:15.059
I'll let you know as soon as I hear anything.

491
34:20.949 --> 34:22.812
This is all your fault!

492
34:23.851 --> 34:25.840
You knew Titus was already upset with you.

493
34:26.358 --> 34:28.800
- And you still went and chopped up her banana doll! - Dad!

494
34:29.691 --> 34:31.760
Didn't this whole mess start because you have a mistress?

495
34:32.310 --> 34:33.520
Why are you blaming Mom?

496
34:33.893 --> 34:34.694
Tetris!

497
34:34.728 --> 34:38.760
Even the kids know who's responsible

498
34:39.046 --> 34:41.677
for all the chaos in this family. Wake up, Phop!

499
34:41.838 --> 34:43.560
And start changing your ways!

500
34:44.227 --> 34:45.228
Exactly!

501
34:46.054 --> 34:48.112
Try to leave your children something to respect you for.

502
34:51.515 --> 34:52.886
Break up with that woman right now,

503
34:53.500 --> 34:55.501
before our family falls apart completely.

504
34:58.301 --> 35:00.000
Now you're all ganging up on me!

505
35:00.531 --> 35:01.720
Nobody's going anywhere.

506
35:02.678 --> 35:04.880
We're all staying here until Titus comes home.

507
35:11.163 --> 35:14.880
- No! I'm not going back! Let me go! - Titus, calm down. Just listen to me!

508
35:14.910 --> 35:18.240
I won't listen! You're on Mom's side anyway! Get out!

509
35:18.700 --> 35:19.744
Titus!

510
35:19.856 --> 35:22.000
I want to stay with Ta! I told you to go home!

511
35:22.057 --> 35:24.470
- I'm not going back! I'm staying with Ta! Just go home! - Titus!

512
35:24.500 --> 35:25.501
I'm not going back.

513
35:25.550 --> 35:26.551
Titus.

514
35:27.326 --> 35:28.960
Do you still want to be friends with me?

515
35:30.800 --> 35:32.120
Of course.

516
35:34.352 --> 35:35.880
But if you don't go home,

517
35:36.592 --> 35:40.760
your mom will get even angrier with me and blame me for making you disobedient.

518
35:41.334 --> 35:44.294
She might even call the police and have me arrested.

519
35:44.896 --> 35:46.086
Because you're still a child,

520
35:46.592 --> 35:49.440
you can't stay at someone else's home without your parents' permission.

521
35:50.811 --> 35:52.360
And if things get that serious,

522
35:53.414 --> 35:54.680
we might never see each other again.

523
35:57.739 --> 36:01.640
But I really don't want to go home.

524
36:05.837 --> 36:06.838
How about this?

525
36:08.366 --> 36:11.320
Why don't you stay here with me for one night?

526
36:12.344 --> 36:13.645
Then you can go home tomorrow.

527
36:14.774 --> 36:16.440
And when you get home, tell your mom

528
36:16.700 --> 36:18.760
you'd like to come visit me more often.

529
36:18.849 --> 36:20.480
Because you love me.

530
36:20.850 --> 36:25.320
If you ask her nicely, I'm sure she'll say yes. Right?

531
36:37.801 --> 36:39.464
Can't she just go home tonight?

532
36:42.182 --> 36:44.224
Okay, let's do that then.

533
36:45.798 --> 36:46.799
Please take care of her.

534
36:50.486 --> 36:51.487
That bitch!

535
36:51.811 --> 36:54.640
It's not enough that she seduces men. Now she's manipulating a child too!

536
36:55.200 --> 36:56.835
What's wrong? What did Veekit say?

537
36:58.670 --> 36:59.671
Veekit said

538
37:00.256 --> 37:02.520
Titus wants to stay there tonight and come home tomorrow.

539
37:03.019 --> 37:04.544
And Veekit will stay there to look after her.

540
37:05.120 --> 37:07.121
Oh, no way!

541
37:07.456 --> 37:09.926
That bitch is definitely going to seduce Veekit! I won't allow it!

542
37:10.923 --> 37:13.960
That's true! Every man who gets close to her falls into her trap!

543
37:14.198 --> 37:16.784
Napha, let's take the police to her condo

544
37:16.838 --> 37:18.440
and rescue Titus and Veekit.

545
37:19.456 --> 37:21.960
Veekit said Titus refuses to come home no matter what he says.

546
37:22.208 --> 37:24.320
Forcing her will only make things worse.

547
37:26.395 --> 37:28.651
I'm sure that bitch planned this whole thing.

548
37:29.110 --> 37:30.800
I'd love to drag her out and beat the hell out of her.

549
37:30.840 --> 37:31.841
Okay, how about this?

550
37:34.840 --> 37:37.864
I'll go stay with Titus and send Veekit home.

551
37:39.102 --> 37:40.103
Not a chance!

552
37:41.027 --> 37:42.560
You're just taking advantage of the situation.

553
37:43.387 --> 37:46.720
If you go, your daughter will come home alone in a taxi tomorrow,

554
37:46.944 --> 37:48.688
while you'll be in bed with that woman all day and night.

555
37:49.280 --> 37:52.123
Hey, but what if Veekit falls for her tricks?

556
37:52.896 --> 37:57.120
Our family will lose two good men to the same woman.

557
37:57.584 --> 37:59.560
There won't be any men left in our family.

558
38:05.086 --> 38:06.320
I trust Veekit.

559
38:08.051 --> 38:11.960
He wouldn't be blinded by lust like Phop.

560
38:22.221 --> 38:24.720
Watch out for that bitch, Veekit. I'm worried about you.

561
38:27.131 --> 38:30.400
Don't worry. I can handle myself. Go to bed.

562
38:44.165 --> 38:45.200
How's Titus?

563
38:46.640 --> 38:47.641
She's asleep.

564
38:49.140 --> 38:50.518
You're pretty good with kids, aren't you?

565
38:53.465 --> 38:54.819
You mean I'm good at manipulating them?

566
38:56.467 --> 38:57.640
You're good at manipulating adults too.

567
38:58.982 --> 39:02.200
But you're a magician. Aren't you better at fooling people?

568
39:04.352 --> 39:06.491
Magicians aren't con artists, you know.

569
39:08.019 --> 39:09.760
We don't hide the truth from anyone.

570
39:17.048 --> 39:19.249
The audience knows they're watching an illusion.

571
39:30.659 --> 39:32.240
They know they're being fooled by a trick.

572
39:48.613 --> 39:49.680
But con artists

573
39:50.880 --> 39:52.805
mix the truth with lies.

574
39:54.294 --> 39:55.824
Until you can't tell them apart.

575
39:58.038 --> 39:59.680
The people being deceived often don't even realize it.

576
40:01.397 --> 40:04.860
And sometimes, even when someone's sitting right in front of us,

577
40:06.183 --> 40:07.500
we still have no idea

578
40:09.431 --> 40:11.520
who they really are.

579
40:14.749 --> 40:16.886
When you watch other magicians perform,

580
40:17.846 --> 40:19.250
can you ever figure out their tricks?

581
40:22.187 --> 40:23.188
Of course.

582
40:24.288 --> 40:25.520
I'm very observant.

583
40:26.622 --> 40:28.360
I can spot even the slightest thing that's off.

584
40:30.894 --> 40:32.781
And it's not just magicians I can see through.

585
40:35.576 --> 40:36.960
I can spot liars too.

586
40:41.251 --> 40:44.480
So what am I to you?

587
40:45.640 --> 40:46.760
A magician or a liar?

588
40:52.838 --> 40:54.560
If I can't see through you, you're a magician.

589
40:56.470 --> 40:57.471
But if I can,

590
40:59.579 --> 41:00.688
then you're a liar.

591
41:04.125 --> 41:06.320
People are always trying to figure out magic tricks.

592
41:07.470 --> 41:08.760
Don't take it so seriously.

593
41:10.462 --> 41:12.320
Just enjoy the show.

594
42:11.630 --> 42:13.480
Mommy Ta! Mommy Ta!

595
42:24.040 --> 42:27.880
Why did you call her that? Why?

596
42:41.534 --> 42:45.363
Hey, make sure you apologize to Mom first, okay?

597
42:46.535 --> 42:48.320
Will Mom apologize to me too?

598
42:49.531 --> 42:52.840
Of course. She knows she went too far.

599
42:54.704 --> 42:55.705
Ready?

600
42:57.000 --> 42:58.001
Let's go.

601
43:06.312 --> 43:08.179
Oh, you're back!

602
43:10.648 --> 43:11.926
How was it?

603
43:12.531 --> 43:16.160
Did my little adventurer have fun?

604
43:20.132 --> 43:21.133
Titus.

605
43:27.611 --> 43:28.612
Mom.

606
43:31.035 --> 43:32.036
I'm sorry.

607
43:34.395 --> 43:37.300
I won't run away from home again.

608
43:38.859 --> 43:41.443
I'll ask for permission before going anywhere.

609
43:45.552 --> 43:46.553
Good girl.

610
43:48.350 --> 43:50.080
I'll let you go wherever you want.

611
43:51.390 --> 43:53.075
Except to see that woman.

612
44:00.131 --> 44:01.960
Throw that away. I'll buy you a new one.

613
44:11.979 --> 44:14.720
You're so mean! You're cruel! I hate you!

614
44:14.774 --> 44:16.200
I hate you when you're like this!

615
44:16.246 --> 44:17.320
- Titus! - Wait!

616
44:17.347 --> 44:19.904
Who taught you to talk like that? Was it that woman?

617
44:19.979 --> 44:21.960
She taught you that, didn't she? Didn't she?

618
44:22.315 --> 44:23.560
- She taught you that, didn't she? - Napha, calm down!

619
44:23.606 --> 44:25.579
Calm down!

620
44:25.607 --> 44:26.718
You wicked mother!

621
44:27.500 --> 44:28.854
Titus! Titus!

622
44:29.000 --> 44:30.427
Why are you being so disrespectful?

623
44:30.598 --> 44:32.440
- Titus! - Hey! Hey!

624
44:33.686 --> 44:34.687
I'll go check on her.

625
44:40.576 --> 44:41.577
Phop!

626
44:41.947 --> 44:44.758
That bitch has poisoned our daughter's mind and turned her into a little monster!

627
44:44.832 --> 44:46.374
What are you going to do about it?

628
45:00.798 --> 45:02.424
- Hello? - Hey!

629
45:03.139 --> 45:04.800
The fingerprint results are back.

630
45:05.120 --> 45:08.560
Good! Make several copies and keep them safe.

631
45:09.000 --> 45:10.240
That bitch Nopnapha is capable of anything.

632
45:10.336 --> 45:11.960
She might try to steal the evidence back.

633
45:12.187 --> 45:15.720
There's no trace of Nopnapha's fingerprints!

634
45:16.070 --> 45:18.071
What? None of her fingerprints?

635
45:18.272 --> 45:19.560
Then whose fingerprints are on it?

636
45:20.300 --> 45:23.480
Jenphop's. His are the only fingerprints on it.

637
45:23.707 --> 45:26.840
The phone belongs to Jenphop, not Nopnapha.

638
45:29.763 --> 45:31.564
Munin, are you listening?

639
45:34.764 --> 45:35.765
Munin!

640
45:36.290 --> 45:39.320
You've been going after the wrong person all along!

641
46:00.115 --> 46:03.120
Based on the evidence we have now, our prime suspect

642
46:03.160 --> 46:04.520
is Jenphop.

643
46:12.120 --> 46:14.040
The uncle and nephew might be working together.

644
46:14.179 --> 46:16.240
True. But I have someone else in mind

645
46:16.926 --> 46:19.127
who can give us inside information on Jenphop.

646
46:19.347 --> 46:20.348
Who?

647
46:22.512 --> 46:23.880
People are saying

648
46:24.533 --> 46:28.234
you are the most vicious mistress in history.

649
46:28.379 --> 46:33.280
I wonder who told the Minister about Ta's affair with the Director.

650
46:34.451 --> 46:35.720
It could be you, Hong.

651
46:36.520 --> 46:38.600
A legendary slap like this?

652
46:38.678 --> 46:40.440
I've got to see it up close!

653
46:43.840 --> 46:44.841
Don't tell me...
